1431
01:18:16,132 --> 01:18:19,813
[SPEAKER_03]: In fact, on off days, no, that's mostly what we did.

1432
01:18:19,893 --> 01:18:23,434
[SPEAKER_02]: I also started hearing about Charlie Berry died.

1433
01:18:23,774 --> 01:18:24,955
